<b>Nope!</b>

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:26.350
<b>What?! But then does that I mean I have to do it... alone?</b>

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:27.140
<b>Yep!</b>

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:32.700
<b><i>When underwater, there are times you can barely see even three meters ahead.</i></b>

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.180
